{%- style -%}
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} { margin-top: 0; }
  {%- comment -%} touch-action pan-y: el navegador conserva el scroll vertical y el JS recibe el swipe horizontal. {%- endcomment -%}
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__viewport { overflow: hidden; position: relative; background: #161616; touch-action: pan-y; }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__track { display: flex; transition: transform .6s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1); }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__slide { flex: 0 0 100%; min-width: 100%; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__slide img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; z-index: 0; animation: pewmanSlideZoom-{{ section.id }} 20s ease-out infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes pewmanSlideZoom-{{ section.id }} { from { transform: scale(1); } to { transform: scale(1.09); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__slide img { animation: none; } }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__inner {
    position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;
    min-height: clamp(500px, 56vw, 820px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  }
  {%- comment -%}
    Recuadro SEMITRANSPARENTE en vez de degradado sobre toda la foto
    (referencia Dalila 2026-08-12): la foto debe verse a traves del color
    (alpha .82) y el boton va DENTRO del recuadro, no colgando afuera.
    --pewman-box lo fija cada slide segun su producto (style inline abajo,
    ya convertido a rgba en liquid).
    Proporcion apaisada a proposito (Cris 2026-08-12): mas ancho que alto,
    con tipografia y padding contenidos, para que el recuadro no tape la foto.
    A 600px de ancho el titular caia en 5 lineas y el recuadro cubria casi
    todo el alto del banner.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Desplazado bajo y a la izquierda del centro (Cris 2026-08-12). El corrimiento
    lateral solo corre en pantallas anchas: bajo 1400px el contenedor de 1200px
    deja apenas 24px de margen y el recuadro se saldria del viewport.
    GEOMETRIA COMPARTIDA (Dalila via Cris 2026-08-13): caja de proporcion mas
    cuadrada (600px x ~420px, contenido centrado) y de tamano FIJO aunque el
    texto varie, para que el recuadro se vea identico en todos los heroes del
    sitio (Home, Casos, Empresa, Prensa, productos) y no salte al cambiar de
    pagina. Si se toca aca, replicar en pewman-page-hero y pewman-product-hero.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__tx {
    max-width: 600px; min-height: clamp(340px, 23vw, 420px); width: 100%;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--pewman-box, rgba(189, 0, 40, 0.82)); border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px 40px;
    transform: translateY(48px);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1400px) {
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__tx { transform: translate(-70px, 48px); }
  }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__kicker {
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff;
    background: var(--pewman-rojo); display: inline-block; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__heading { font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 36px); color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.12; }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__body { font-size: clamp(14px, 1.15vw, 16px); color: #e9e9e9; max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__cta { display: flex; gap: 11px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__cta .pewman-btn { font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 22px; }
  {%- comment -%}
    Flechas solo en movil (Cris 2026-08-12): en desktop bastan los dots y el
    autoplay. Van abajo en las esquinas, a la altura de los dots, porque a
    media altura quedarian encima del recuadro de texto (que en movil ocupa
    casi todo el ancho).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__arrow { display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__arrow {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      position: absolute; bottom: 8px; z-index: 3;
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0;
      background: rgba(8, 12, 16, 0.38); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      color: #fff; cursor: pointer;
    }
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__arrow--prev { left: 12px; }
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__arrow--prev svg { transform: scaleX(-1); }
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__arrow--next { right: 12px; }
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__arrow svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
  }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__dots { position: absolute; bottom: 22px; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 3; display: flex; gap: 9px; justify-content: center; }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__dots button {
    width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #fff; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; padding: 0; transition: .2s;
  }
  #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__dots button.is-active { background: var(--pewman-rojo); border-color: var(--pewman-rojo); width: 26px; border-radius: 7px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    /* padding-top >= alto del header movil (76px) + aire: el kicker se montaba sobre el logo */
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__inner { min-height: clamp(460px, 84vw, 580px); padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 54px; }
    #PewmanHero-{{ section.id }} .pewman-hero__tx { padding: 24px 22px; border-radius: 16px; transform: none; min-height: 0; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<pewman-slideshow id="PewmanHero-{{ section.id }}" data-autoplay="{{ section.settings.autoplay }}" data-speed="{{ section.settings.autoplay_speed }}" aria-label="Destacados">
  <div class="pewman-hero__viewport">
    <div class="pewman-hero__track" data-track>
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'slide' -%}
          <div class="pewman-hero__slide" style="--pewman-box: {{ block.settings.box_color | default: '#BD0028' | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.82 }};" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if block.settings.image -%}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
                srcset="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 2400 }} 2400w, {{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 3200 }} 3200w"
                sizes="100vw"
                alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape | default: block.settings.heading | escape }}"
                loading="{% if forloop.index == 1 %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}"
              >
            {%- endif -%}
            <div class="pewman-hero__inner">
              <div class="pewman-hero__tx">
                {%- if block.settings.kicker_text != blank -%}
                  <span class="pewman-hero__kicker">{{ block.settings.kicker_text }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- comment -%}
                  Solo el primer slide lleva H1: la pagina debe tener uno solo
                  (habia 3, uno por slide, y los buscadores no saben cual manda).
                  Los demas van en H2 con la misma clase, se ven identicos.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
                  {%- if forloop.first -%}
                    <h1 class="pewman-hero__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h1>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <h2 class="pewman-hero__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.body_text != blank -%}
                  <div class="pewman-hero__body">{{ block.settings.body_text }}</div>
                {%- endif -%}
                <div class="pewman-hero__cta">
                  {%- if block.settings.button_1_label != blank -%}
                    {% render 'pewman-cta-button', text: block.settings.button_1_label, url: block.settings.button_1_link, variant: 'light' %}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.button_2_label != blank -%}
                    {% render 'pewman-cta-button', text: block.settings.button_2_label, url: block.settings.button_2_link, variant: 'dark' %}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pewman-hero__dots" data-dots></div>
</pewman-slideshow>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Pewman · Hero carrusel",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "pewman-hero-slideshow-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "autoplay", "label": "Autoplay", "default": true },
    { "type": "range", "id": "autoplay_speed", "label": "Velocidad autoplay (segundos)", "min": 3, "max": 10, "step": 0.5, "default": 6.5 }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "name": "Slide",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Imagen de fondo" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "kicker_text", "label": "Texto destacado (kicker)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Titular" },
        { "type": "richtext", "id": "body_text", "label": "Texto" },
        { "type": "color", "id": "box_color", "label": "Color del recuadro de texto", "default": "#BD0028" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "button_1_label", "label": "Botón 1 · texto" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "button_1_link", "label": "Botón 1 · link" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "button_2_label", "label": "Botón 2 · texto" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "button_2_link", "label": "Botón 2 · link" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Pewman · Hero carrusel",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "slide", "settings": { "kicker_text": "Pewman Innovation", "heading": "Biotecnología basada en microorganismos de ambientes extremos", "button_1_label": "Conoce más de nuestra tecnología", "button_2_label": "Ver productos", "button_2_link": "#soluciones" } },
        { "type": "slide", "settings": { "kicker_text": "Producción, cuidado y resistencia", "heading": "¿Estás preparado para proteger tus cultivos de las heladas?", "button_1_label": "Ver Crioprotect", "button_2_label": "Ver productos", "button_2_link": "#soluciones" } },
        { "type": "slide", "settings": { "kicker_text": "Más producción con menos agua", "heading": "¿Estás preparado para enfrentar la sequía?", "button_1_label": "Ver Nanoforte", "button_2_label": "Ver productos", "button_2_link": "#soluciones" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}